    "created_at": "2026-11-24T08:00:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-24T08:00:56Z",
    "body": "fix on issue/3824-pass-link-edge-route · PR #3855 · pinned by lifts::fig8_start_sides_lift_only_with_a_named_reason, ring_side::tests::the_side_tolerance_keeps_a_real_short_wall_and_drops_a_flat_sliver · merges when reviewed\n\nThe edge route alone did not change the fig8 count (Inside 6, Outside 12). The cause was the side tolerance `level_rings::SIDE_EPS` (1 um, below the 5 um arc flats). It read two 0.117 mm stretches of the part wall as the stock side. With 10 um: Inside 0 lifts, Outside 3 (each named). The pass link also tries `edge_route` now, with the same proof.",
